            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A display device includes a plurality of displays, and a controller. The displays are configured to, when an apparatus is performing an operation, display a state of the apparatus. The controller is configured to, in response to an error occurring in the apparatus, display an indication of occurrence of the error on the displays in a manner that causes all or a subset of the displays to turn on for a predetermined period of time and then turn off for a predetermined period of time.</p>
            </abstract>
